"The Peppol document %(name)s is missing: %(missing)s. Check the Peppol "
"e-address (EAS) and Endpoint on both your company and the counterparty."
msgstr ""
"V Peppol doklade %(name)s chýba: %(missing)s. Skontrolujte Peppol e-adresu "
"(EAS) a koncový bod pri vašej spoločnosti aj pri protistrane."

